  "description": "The bull market is still intact. Here’s what I’m watching now so I’m ready when that changes.",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>We’re still in a technical bull market. I’m not shorting these stocks today.</strong></p><p>But eventually, that will change, and I want the short list built <em>before</em> the market begins giving us break down signals. </p><p>In today’s video, I go through the names currently making that list, including NVDA and AVGO, and <strong>what would need to change before I’d actually consider shorting them.</strong></p><p><strong>This is the same process we used in reverse in 2022, 2023 and 2024, building buy lists before the opportunities arrived.</strong></p><p><strong>We have several stocks that we continue to hold in this bull market. Today, notably, silver has been pushing higher. I covered silver several times, the most recent </strong>July 31<sup>st</sup> where I explicitly stated that <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/is-this-rally-finally-real\">Silver was going to push upwards</a>. Silver is up +15.7% since then, and I am expecting Silver to continue climbing to much higher prices. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png\" width=\"1430\" height=\"894\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:894,&quot;width&quot;:1430,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:475415,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/211584624?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Zze!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe84d2306-d927-4fb6-8222-771ae50e9a2d_1430x894.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I understand bearish narratives aren’t popular. And I don’t expect many of these stocks to stay down forever when the next downturn comes.</p><p>But that doesn’t mean there won’t be excellent opportunities along the way, especially in some of the AI names that have attracted so much attention.</p><p><strong>The time to build a short list is now. Not several months from now when we’re already in a bear market.</strong></p><p>For now, just keep these names in the back of your mind. <strong>When the market starts giving us the signals I’m looking for, I’ll walk you through exactly what I’m seeing and what I’m doing about it.</strong></p><p><strong>Thanks for stopping by! </strong></p><h4><strong>Don’t forget to like ❤️ and re-stack! 🔄</strong></h4><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Like this content and seeing both sides of the market? Subscribe to stay updated and informed. </p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>",
